0:38.078" end="00:41.309"><span begin="00:38.078" end="00:38.243">And </span><span begin="00:38.243" end="00:38.544">now </span><span begin="00:38.544" end="00:38.895">your </span><span begin="00:38.895" end="00:39.908">song </span><span begin="00:39.908" end="00:40.082">is </span><span begin="00:40.082" end="00:40.475">on </span><span begin="00:40.475" end="00:41.309">repeat</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.623" end="00:45.144"><span begin="00:41.623" end="00:41.804">And </span><span begin="00:41.804" end="00:42.011">I'm </span><span begin="00:42.011" end="00:42.778">dancin' </span><span begin="00:42.778" end="00:43.879">on </span><span begin="00:43.879" end="00:44.009">to </span><span begin="00:44.009" end="00:44.441">your </span><span begin="00:44.441" end="00:45.144">heartbeat</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.745" end="00:49.030"><span begin="00:45.745" end="00:45.948">And </span><span begin="00:45.948" end="00:46.319">when </span><span begin="00:46.319" end="00:46.648">you're </span><span begin="00:46.648" end="00:47.552">gone </span><span begin="00:47.552" end="00:47.706">I </span><span begin="00:47.706" end="00:47.956">feel </span><span begin="00:47.956" end="00:49.030">incomplete</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.393" end="00:51.122"><span begin="00:49.393" end="00:49.578">So </span><span begin="00:49.578" end="00:49.743">if </span><span begin="00:49.743" end="00:49.914">you </span><span begin="00:49.914" end="00:50.265">want </span><span begin="00:50.265" end="00:50.556">the </span><span begin="00:50.556" end="00:51.122">truth</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.812" end="00:55.821"><span begin="00:52.812" end="00:53.109">I </span><span begin="00:53.109" end="00:53.290">just </span><span begin="00:53.290" end="00:53.714">wanna </span><span begin="00:53.714" end="00:53.977">be </span><span begin="00:53.977" end="00:54.295">part </span><span begin="00:54.295" end="00:54.473">of </span><span begin="00:54.473" end="00:54.706">your </